"use strict";

/* generated from story/scenes/act1_ch3.md — do not edit */

Object.assign(ENEMIES,{bully:{name:"Liu Feng, Outer Court Bully",hp:12,open:"Feng cracks his knuckles. \u201CThe gold-haired ghost wants a beating.\u201D",
  moves:[{n:"Wild swing",d:3},{n:"Shove and kick",d:2},{n:"Haymaker wind-up",kind:"charge",text:"Feng rears back, telegraphing a huge haymaker.",tele:"He is winding up something big."},{n:"Haymaker",d:6,kind:"release"}]}});


SC["c1_feng_fight"]={combat:"bully",
 win:"c1_feng_win",
 lose:"c1_feng_lose",
 t:()=>((G.f.mouthy)?(P(`Feng's grin curdles. “The cripple talks back.” He rolls his sleeves.`)):(P(`Your knuckles catch his jaw before you've decided anything. The courtyard whoops.`)))};

SC["c1_feng_win"]={t:()=>P(`Feng sits down in the spilled water, nose bleeding, eyes wide with the special outrage of bullies meeting arithmetic they didn't order.`)+((G.f.bg==="kata")?(P(`Ten thousand repetitions in a strip-mall dojo, it turns out, cross worlds just fine.`)):(P(`You're as surprised as he is, but you don't let your face know it.`)))+P(`“Crippled,” you say, picking up your buckets, “not helpless.” Nobody trips you again that week.`)+SYS(`Reputation: the gold ghost bites.`),
 c:()=>[{id:"c0",l:`Continue`,do:()=>{G.f.beatFeng=true;G.hp=G.maxhp;},go:"a1c2_hierarchy"}]};

SC["c1_feng_lose"]={t:()=>P(`You wake up under the water-trough with a split lip and one eye swelling shut. Bao is dabbing your face with his sleeve and pretending not to be furious. “You absolute turnip,” he says. “Feng has three years and thirty pounds on you.”`)+P(`“Had to check,” you mumble. And you did learn something, down there in the mud: when Feng's fist came in, you <i>saw</i> something. A glint. A tight gold line in the air, connecting shoulder to fist to your face. You saw the blow as a thread, a heartbeat before it landed.`)+SYS(`Defeat — but Insight grows in the mud.`),
 c:()=>[{id:"c0",l:`Continue`,do:()=>{addIns(1);G.bao++;note("Bao +1");G.hp=G.maxhp;},go:"a1c2_hierarchy"}]};

SC["c1_night"]={t:()=>SYS(`CHAPTER THREE — FIRST KNOT`)+DIV+P(`Midnight, three weeks in. You can't sleep. You sit on the kitchen steps under a foreign moon, homesickness sitting on your chest like a stone, and you finally let yourself think the thought you've been outrunning: <i>I died. My sister turned the porch light on and I never came home.</i>`)+P(`Your eyes blur. And through the blur — the courtyard <b>lights up</b>.`)+P(`Threads. Everywhere. Drifting off the lanterns in lazy gold spirals, rooted thick and slow in the old pine, rushing in silver torrents along the stone channels the cultivators call dragon veins. The whole mountain is a loom, strung and humming, and every soul on it is blind to the weave but you.`)+((G.f.bg==="music")?(P(`They hum. Each thread a held note. The pine is a drone, the lanterns are grace notes, and the dragon vein under the steps is the bass line of the world.`)):(((G.f.bg==="code")?(P(`Your mind does what it has always done: pattern, structure, syntax. The threads cross in repeatable junctions. Knots are operators. The mountain is running a program.`)):(((G.f.bg==="kata")?(P(`You know this feeling. It's the dojo feeling — the moment a form stops being steps and becomes one unbroken line. The threads move like that. Like kata.`)):(P(`They look like the friendship bracelets your sister used to knot, gone vast and alive. You know how those are made. Over, under, pull tight.`)))))))+P(`One thin gold thread drifts within reach of your hand.`),
 c:()=>[{id:"c0",l:`Grab it and PULL.`,do:()=>{G.hp-=2;note("-2 HP","loss");addIns(1);},go:"c1_pull"},
  {id:"c1",l:`Match it first — its tension, its hum — and only then touch.`,go:"c1_hum"}]};

SC["c1_pull"]={t:()=>P(`The thread snaps like a live wire. Gold light cracks across your palm and the recoil knocks you off the step, ears ringing, fingers scorched.`)+P(`But pain is information. The thread didn't break because it was weak. It broke because you fought its tension instead of working with it. Lesson one, written in burn-blisters.`),
 c:()=>[{id:"c0",l:`Try again, properly this time.`,go:"a1c3_attempts"}]};

SC["a1c3_attempts"]={t:()=>P(`Properly, it turns out, is a language you don't speak yet.`)+P(`The second thread you take too gently, and it pours through your fingers like smoke with somewhere better to be. The third you time wrong: there is a rhythm to them, a slow pulse like breathing, and you grab on the exhale and get a crack across the knuckles for it. The fourth simply refuses you, sliding around your hand the way a cat declines a stranger, and by now your fingers are blistered, the moon has moved, and you are sitting in a foreign courtyard at the bottom of a mountain that eats children's futures, failing at the only thing in two worlds that has ever looked back at you.`)+((G.f.bg==="kata")?(P(`And then you stop. Because you know this wall. It's the white-belt wall, the one where you muscle the technique because you don't trust it yet. Sensei used to tap your shoulders until they dropped. <i>Stop doing the throw. Let the throw happen.</i>`)):(((G.f.bg==="music")?(P(`And then you stop. Because you know this wall. It's the practice-room wall, the passage you keep bricking because you're playing the notes instead of the phrase. You can't fight your way through it. You have to come at it like it's already music.`)):(((G.f.bg==="code")?(P(`And then you stop. Because you know this wall. It's the debugger wall: you've changed the same line nine times, and the bug is not on that line. The error isn't in your grip. It's in your model.`)):(P(`And then you stop. Because you know this wall. It's the little-sister wall: the night she cried because the bracelet knots kept collapsing, and you took her hands and said, stop pulling so hard, it's not trying to get away from you.`)))))))+P(`The threads aren't tools. They're alive the way the river was alive. You don't seize a current.`),
 c:()=>[{id:"c0",l:`Stop trying to hold it. Introduce yourself instead.`,go:"c1_hum"}]};

SC["c1_hum"]={t:()=>P(`You go quiet inside. You find the thread's tension —`)+((G.f.bg==="music")?(P(`you hum its note back to it, softly, the way you'd tune to a band already playing —`)):(((G.f.bg==="code")?(P(`you match its clock, letting your breath sync to its slow pulse like two systems finding one heartbeat —`)):(((G.f.bg==="kata")?(P(`you breathe with it, the way you'd match a partner's rhythm before a throw, following before leading —`)):(P(`you hold your hand open the way you taught small fingers to hold yarn: gently, like it's alive, because it is —`)))))))+P(`— and when your fingers close, the thread <i>stays</i>. Warm. Alive. Yours to bend.`)+P(`Over. Under. Pull tight.`)+P(`The knot blazes once, soft gold, and holds: a tiny, perfect stitch of solid light hanging in the dark, the first deliberate thing you have made in this world.`)+SYS(`You have stepped onto a path with no name in any sect manual. The threads are visible only to a soul the Loom carried from another Heaven. You are a <b>SPINNER</b> — and now, with one true knot, a <b>KNOTTER</b>.`)+P(`Footsteps. Liu Feng, returning drunk from the village, spots you sitting in the dark being weird. “Ghost boy,” he slurs, fists already rising, and your hand moves on its own — a thread, a loop, a tug —`),
 c:()=>[{id:"c0",l:`Over. Under. Pull TIGHT.`,do:()=>{realmUp();learn("snare","Snare Knot");},go:"c1_snare"}]};

SC["c1_snare"]={t:()=>P(`A knot of gold light cinches around Feng's ankle. He goes down like a sack of millet, face-first, hiccups once, and starts snoring in the dirt.`)+P(`You stare at your own hands for a long time.`)+P(`“Interesting,” says a voice like dry leaves, “that the courtyard should sing tonight.”`)+P(`The old blind sweeper, Granny Sho, the one even elders step around without knowing why, stands at the edge of the yard, milk-white eyes pointed exactly at your knot of light. “I heard the Weave once, boy. The night it took my eyes. Souls born under this Heaven cannot see it.” Her cane taps once. “So. What are you?”`),
 c:()=>[{id:"c0",l:`Tell her the truth. The rain, the wire, the Loom between worlds. All of it.`,do:()=>{G.sho+=2;note("Granny Sho +2");addIns(1);},go:"a1c3_first_pattern"},
  {id:"c1",l:`“Just a cripple who sees things. Goodnight, Granny.”`,go:"a1c3_first_pattern"}]};

SC["a1c3_first_pattern"]={t:()=>P(`You spend the next week's small hours in the woodshed behind the kitchens, learning your art the way the first human learned fire: alone, burned, delighted.`)+P(`The grammar assembles itself out of blisters. Threads answer attention, not force. Each knot costs you something — not qi, you have nowhere to keep qi, but a kind of reach, a budget of held tension that runs out and refills as you rest. Two threads, you can hold now. The night you understand that the budget itself can grow, that understanding is the muscle, you sit back on the woodpile and laugh until you have to put a fist in your mouth.`)+SYS(`The shape of the path: Patterns are knots. Knots cost Threads. Thread capacity grows with realm — and realms open to understanding, not to sweat. Somewhere above Knotter: Weaver. Somewhere above that, the words run out.`)+P(`Bao finds you there one dawn, too pleased with himself to wait for breakfast. “Ledger news,” he announces. “You know why Feng's been drinking like a soldier? His patron's been fined a season's allowance. Outer court discipline board.” He counts off on his fingers, savoring it. “And his patron is — wait for it — Qiu's nephew. The abacus boy. Feng trips servants for the counting room, gold-hair. Every bucket you've lost was a budget line.”`)+((G.f.beatFeng)?(P(`Which means the boy you put in the mud was somebody's investment. The fine wasn't discipline. It was a margin call.`)):(""))+P(`The basement, it turns out, has an upstairs. Everything down here is connected to something up there by a thread. And you're getting better at threads.`),
 c:()=>[{id:"c0",l:`Autumn is coming. So, apparently, is a teacher.`,go:"c2_open"}]};